WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.930
Loropeni ɓadake. Ɗuum ko haala taariika, ɗum laaɓɓi ngam hollaago.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.824
Hannde, nder worgo hirnaange Burkina, cuuɗi mawɗi ɗi kaaƴe ɗon ƴiwo diga ladde.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.988
Mo waɗi ɗi? Ngam ɗume? Eɗen ndaara wakkati.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.986
Kamɓe ɗon ummii, gooto e go'oto. Duule mawɗe ɗe ɗowanteeje ɗon ummake, diga na'i ɗuɗɗi.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:57.900
Yimɓe Lohron, koo Koolango, maama'en ardiiɓe Touna njooɗi nokkuure nden. Ɗu'um e ɓaawo maɓɓe, cuuɗi mum'en ɗon njaɓɓa.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.808
Haa dow, wallol ngol footi jaŋgugo duuɓi ujuneeje!

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.440
O ɗon hisna ko leydi ndii jogori ɓurɗum daraja.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.218
Jaŋde. Ɓe mbaɗata ɗum nder leydi ndii e nder maayoji.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:48.266
Debbo'en ɗon laaɓta geɗal bee kaalabas. Haa ɓaawo maajum, laaɓuɗe goɗɗe ɗon cembiɗa.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:58.304
Ɗu'um ɓeydi ɗuuɗugo, ammaa ɗi ɗon mari risku lesdi fuu.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:16.352
Nder berniwol mawɗo mo ummaatooje maɓɓitooɗi, yimɓe gooduɓe feyru ɓe ngaɗata kuuje ceede.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:28.090
Mawɓe jaayndiyankooɓe ɗon ngari diga naange. Kamɓe e yimɓe maɓɓe ɓe ngaddani ko'e maɓɓe, ɓe ngaɗana ɗum.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:35.532
To' on meemi mo, o laaɓɗo".

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.400
Ɗo'o booɗɗum, ammaa ɗum ceede masin ngam am.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.932
Ngam maajum, naa' masin!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:54.346
Mawɗo'en keɓata kaŋgeeri nder suudu maako. Ɗuum woni ko ɓooyi, ɗum waɗi en njooɗi.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:26.042
Nden gariiri mawndu ndu'u ɗon cembiɗina. Walaa mo anndi ngam ɗume.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:35.800
Wakkati ɓaawo ɗon, le'i ɗon cembiɗa, lekki boo ɗon maaro nder kaaƴe.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:57.136
E hitaande 2009, Loropeni laati nokku arande Burkina Faso nder UNESCO.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.434
Ɗuum ɓeydaani. Ammaa kaaƴe ɗon haaje.
